  "title": {
    "zh_cn": "皮兰港：核心强化槽",
    "en_us": "Piran Port: Core Enhancement Slots"
  },
  "tags": ["piranport", "ship_core", "enhancement"],
  "editable": false,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "install_enhancement",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "拖放安装强化件",
        "en_us": "Drag-and-Drop Installation"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [2.5, 2.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:medium_ship_core",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "舰装核心自带强化槽：驱逐 2 格、巡洋 3 格、战列 4 格、潜艇 2 格。安装全部在背包里拖放完成，不需要任何机器。",
            "en_us": "Every ship core has enhancement slots: destroyer 2, cruiser 3, battleship 4, submarine 2. Everything installs by drag-and-drop inside your inventory — no machine needed."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.6, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [1.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:small_armor_plate",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [3.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:standard_engine",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [2.5, 3.5, 1.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:standard_sonar",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [2.5, 3.5, 3.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:torpedo_reload",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "打开背包，拿起强化件（装甲板/引擎/声呐/雷达/鱼雷再装填/近防炮）右键点核心——它会被收进第一个空格。",
            "en_us": "In the inventory, pick up an enhancement (armor plate / engine / sonar / radar / torpedo reload / CIWS) and right-click it onto the core — it drops into the first free slot."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 3.6, 2.5],
          "color": "input",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 100
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "空手右键核心，会把最后装入的强化件取回手上——后进先出。只有白名单装备能进强化槽，其余物品一律拒收。",
            "en_us": "Right-click the core with an empty cursor to pull the last-installed piece back out — last in, first out. Only whitelisted equipment fits; anything else is refused."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fuel_drop",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "顺带一提：燃料也是拖进去",
        "en_us": "By the Way: Fuel Drops In Too"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [2.5, 2.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:medium_ship_core",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [3.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 4,
          "item": "piranport:fuel",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "燃料不占强化槽：把舰娘燃料（或岩浆桶等炉料）右键拖到核心上，直接灌进油箱直到加满。",
            "en_us": "Fuel skips the slots entirely: right-click ship fuel (or a lava bucket and other furnace fuels) onto the core to top up the tank."
          },
          "point": [3.5, 3.4, 2.5],
          "color": "input",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 100
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "油箱已满时会发出拒绝音效，不会误吞物品。强化件和燃料共用同一个拖放手势，装什么由物品类型决定。",
            "en_us": "A full tank plays a refusal sound instead of eating your items. Enhancements and fuel share the same drag gesture — the item type decides where it goes."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
